# Standalone quilt for build hosts without the quilt package.
#
# Temporary workaround: without quilt, package() in helpers/config fails
# with "quilt: command not found". If quilt is missing, helpers/config uses
# ./quilt from here instead. The system quilt is always preferred when it is
# installed.
#
# Contents:
#   etc/, usr/  verbatim, unmodified files from Trisquel's quilt package,
#               keeping the package paths. Do not edit anything under them.
#               Included: the quilt command, every quilt subcommand and
#               script, and /etc/quilt.quiltrc. Not included: compat/
#               (symlinks to the host awk, bash and sendmail), the make
#               and debhelper snippets, and the other tools of the package
#               (deb3, dh_quilt_*, dpatch2quilt, guards).
#   SHA256SUMS  checksums of the files under etc/ and usr/, same paths as in
#               the .deb.
#   SOURCE      this file: where the files come from.
#   quilt       wrapper: refuses to run if etc/ or usr/ do not match
#               SHA256SUMS, then runs usr/bin/quilt with QUILT_DIR set to
#               usr/share/quilt and, unless QUILTRC or ~/.quiltrc is set,
#               QUILTRC set to etc/quilt.quiltrc.
#   verify.sh   audit script: checksums, signed archive chain, and
#               byte-for-byte output and tree against the system quilt.
#
# Requirements: bash, patch, diff, perl and coreutils, already needed by
# dpkg-dev. Without them the build fails, as intended. The path of this
# directory must not contain spaces.
#
# Removal: revert the commit that added this directory, or just delete
# helpers/DATA/standalone/quilt. With the directory gone the hook in
# helpers/config does nothing, and a builder without quilt fails as before.
#
# Refresh: download the new .deb from the archive below, extract it with
# dpkg-deb -x, copy the same files, regenerate SHA256SUMS, update the fields
# below, then run ./verify.sh.
#
# License: quilt is GPL-2, see the header of each file under usr/ and
# usr/share/doc/quilt/copyright in the .deb.
# Dates are UTC.

